  "title": "· HERMÈS Kelly Hobo Mini Bucket Bag ·",
  "original_title": "HERMÈS Kelly Hobo 迷你水桶包",
  "excerpt": "Hermès launches the Kelly Hobo bag for SS26, inspired by the 2008 So-Kelly, featuring a sleek calfskin bucket silhouette with adjustable shoulder straps.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-05-16",
  "date_label": "May 16, 2026",
  "cover_image": "/images/w14b80b/07444344bc2b876f.jpg",
