    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For Spring/Summer 2026, HERMÈS introduces the new**Kelly Hobo**bag, drawing inspiration from the 2008 So-Kelly. Crafted from Chéri calfskin, its sleek bucket silhouette features side seams that naturally extend into adjustable shoulder straps, exuding an effortless, free-spirited vibe.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "/images/w14b80b/8b925751e4cb0b68.jpg",
      "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/ce98810563cdec6d.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Design Inspiration ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Debuting on the HERMÈS Spring/Summer 2026 runway, the Kelly Hobo inherits the design language of the So-Kelly, marking the triumphant return of the bucket shape to the Kelly family.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/849777299dd81b81.jpg",
