          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/58a5263fd9c4743b.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/94ce50b3433e0477.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Hermès Spring/Summer 2026 womenswear show",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "/images/w14b80b/49cefd106ce7d806.jpg",
      "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/48f94d53afe64cc9.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Hermès launched the So-Kelly in 2008, designed by then-creative director Jean-Paul Gaultier. It ingeniously fused the iconic Kelly turnlock with a bucket bag silhouette, its soft shape and wide strap offering a comfortable, casual take on the Kelly — perfect for young trendsetters seeking a relaxed everyday bag.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/fff50960ecea7b5d.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/fff50960ecea7b5d.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/1bd7cfd94466e26c.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/a48f29e7774c5403.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Hermès Fall/Winter 2008 collection by Jean-Paul Gaultier",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The original So-Kelly was discontinued in 2016 and has become a coveted vintage piece. The Kelly Hobo revives the bucket look a decade later, with the key difference being its integrated shoulder strap: the side seams extend upward to form the strap, creating a sleeker silhouette, better body contouring, and reduced weight.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
