    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Touret Turnlock ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "/images/w14b80b/2451cc2ca26e1c16.jpg",
      "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/1581a1abae1dc79f.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The**Touret turnlock**is the bag's most iconic Hermès element. First used on the 1930s Kelly, this circular, hollow turnlock pairs with a square keyhole engraved with the HERMES logo. A simple twist opens the flap — both clever and ceremonial.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom view: click to enlarge for ultra-clear detail.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "/images/w14b80b/2702a926860344f9.jpg",
      "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/2702a926860344f9.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The silver turnlock is crafted from palladium-plated brass and secured using Hermès' unique**Pearling**technique. Artisans cut and hammer the rivet tips, then round and polish them to a pearl-like smoothness, ensuring every piece of hardware is both durable and silky to the touch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "/images/w14b80b/b8795af2f42cd658.jpg",
      "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/f0ea8931d0c57a28.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/4b5c6e113bf6ad4e.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/73ce0775884e5eae.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/89e55918d49b1ab4.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/f7191ee876448b60.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "An innovative closure strap wraps the front like a belt, echoing tailoring precision and equestrian aesthetics. The metal nameplate has been repositioned to tuck discreetly behind the strap plaque.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "/images/w14b80b/b31353346662bd5f.jpg",
      "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/243d31a637c47b09.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/72f0385def79e57d.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/78e29fb696e81ab7.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/81eda50da4f4786f.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/4a6634cd41e26190.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Craftsmanship ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "All Hermès bags are sewn using the**Saddle Stitch**technique, a two-needle, one-thread method over a century old. Impossible to machine, it requires each stitch to be hand-sewn with exact spacing and tension, ensuring enduring reliability.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "/images/w14b80b/5dc292f766ba93de.jpg",
      "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/cafd28cce756a7b6.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/b80b9fe3dc6e4cf8.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/1173c754b79a6adf.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/80d154cdcb024635.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/7d64ee54bea5aa5e.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag is made from**Chéri calfskin**, which combines calfskin's durability with lambskin's supple feel, developing a beautiful patina over time. White topstitching traces the edges like fine pencil strokes, adding artisanal charm.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom view: click to enlarge for ultra-clear detail.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
