      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/8bf6c429d1f37b25.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/bc59caa0c5dfa30a.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/703fecaebc118efd.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/e37dca13b238096f.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· What Fits Inside? ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Kelly Hobo comes in**Mini**and**26**sizes. The Mini measures 15×20×7.5cm, and its bucket shape offers generous space. The leather-bound base is reinforced, allowing the bag to stand upright on a flat surface.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "/images/w14b80b/2adf973674360bff.jpg",
      "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/25b29567ffed899c.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/2323d26f62774a29.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/890152f718ec5b17.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/cad6b4b8f81b3f5d.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/2b299c223fb72a35.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We fit an iPhone, notebook, coin purse, jewelry case, tissues, pen, lipstick, perfume, and keys inside. The open top makes access easy, and capacity is ample for daily essentials.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/274f7d854e48bf2f.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/147dc7e64c1e9bcb.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "/images/w14b80b/e887d23dc38a4302.jpg",
          "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/d220002cfdccf0b2.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "/images/w14b80b/eb79bdd51bfada48.jpg",
      "full_url": "/images/w14b80b/8d26721c6a695d41.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Multiple adjustment holes and an Albion buckle let you change the strap length for hand-carry, shoulder, or crossbody wear. When worn on one shoulder, the strap drapes elegantly over the bag's front, channeling a free-spirited vibe.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
