    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "HERMÈS Kelly Hobo MinKYNBAG Designer: Nadège Vanhee-Cybulski Dimensions: 15cm long, 20cm high, 7.5cm base depth Weight: 225g Retail price: ¥70,950 RMB",
      "url": null,
