    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Hermès is the world-renowned French luxury house, celebrated for its handcrafted leather goods and handbags. Founded by Thierry Hermès in 1837 as a harness workshop, it shifted focus to leather goods and handbags in the early 20th century, later expanding into silk scarves, fragrances, ready-to-wear, jewelry, and watches. Iconic bag styles include the**Kelly Bag**and**Birkin Bag**. Since 1837, from Paris.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
